    script:Script, hidden_inputs:Div, action_buttons:Div, hints:Optional[Div]=None,
    manager:Optional[ZoneManager]=None
)-&gt;None:

Container for all keyboard navigation components.
Carries manager so consumers building child systems can hand the underlying ZoneManager to render_keyboard_hints_modal(..., child_managers=[system.manager]) without reconstructing it. Purely additive — pre-existing consumers that unpack the rendered DOM pieces continue to work unchanged.

